# Placeholder env file — deploy pipeline build-context requirement.
#
# OpportunityOS / LYNK is web-only (FastAPI backend + React frontend +
# MongoDB). There is no mobile app. However, the pod's supervisor config
# defines a `[program:mobile]` entry pointing at `/app/mobile`, and the
# Emergent deploy pipeline's build-context step unconditionally attempts
# to read `mobile/.env`. If that file is missing, `prepare build context`
# fails with a PathError and no downstream deploy step runs.
#
# This file exists solely to satisfy that read. It contains no env vars
# and no values. Do NOT add secrets here. If a mobile app is ever added
# to this project, replace this comment block with the real config.
